    <string name="dejavu_sync_firefox_summary">Dònnia computer cun Firefox tenet s\'ispàtziu de traballu suo: is ischedas fissadas abarrant fissadas, is grupos de ischedas diventant cartellas e is àteras ischedas suas si aberint inie. Si serras inoghe una de is ischedas suas, si serrat fintzas in su computer.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_zen_summary">Is ispàtzios de traballu, is ischedas fissadas, is essentziales e is cartellas abarrant uguales in Zen e in Dejavu, in is duas diretziones.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_switch_from_zen">Is ispàtzios de traballu de Zen abarrant in Dejavu, ma no si sincronizant prus.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_switch_from_firefox">Is ispàtzios de traballu de is computer tuos cun Firefox essint dae Dejavu. Firefox mantenit is ischedas issoro.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_problem_choose">Sa sincronizatzione est in pàusa fintzas a cando no seberas Firefox o Zen.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_problem_tabs_off">Sa sincronizatzione de is ischedas abertas est disativada pro su contu Mozilla tuo. Ativa Ischedas abertas in is cunfiguratziones de sincronizatzione de su contu tuo, inoghe o in Firefox.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_problem_no_firefox">Ancora nissunu Firefox in unu computer sincronizat is ischedas abertas suas cun su contu tuo.</string>
